<title>USA: IPO PRICING- Heska Corp prices at $8.50.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- Heska Corp prices at $8.50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			   Heska Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At				     $8.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			5,000,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter Credit Suisse First Boston</p>
<p>NOTE: Terms were modified for the planned initial public offering in Heska Corp. The estimated target price was lowered to $8.50 from $10. Initially, an estimated price range of $14 to $16 was proposed.</p>
<p>The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering in Heska Corp was lowered to five million shares from 5.35 million shares previously.</p>
</text>
